<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>2.5.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00449</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.5.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>505aca80-7eec-4c0f-94be-344b7076a15f</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<para>For questions 1 – 4, add the equations in the system to find a new equation.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise id="c03daac5-e19e-4214-9ed3-81dd1107a242" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 6x - 5y = -1\\ -6x - 3y = -39 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(2y = –38\)</para><para>\(–2y = –40\)</para><para>\(–8y = –40\)</para><para>\(–8x = –40\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \(–8y = –40\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.2. </para><para>The correct answer is \(–8y = –40\).
      </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="cc7025cc-a782-4eac-9737-77a337e29ca4" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 5x - 3y = -1\\ -6x + 3y = -6 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(x = –7\) or \(–x = 7\)</para><para>\(–x = –7\) or \(x = 7\)</para><para>\(–6x = –7\) or \(6x = 7\)</para><para>\(–11x = –7\) or \(11x = 7\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \(–x = –7\) or \(x = 7\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.2. </para><para>The correct answer is \(–x = –7\) or \(x = 7\).
      </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_564b8d2d-aef4-438a-b352-0ef8d4fb0497" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 4x - 3y = 3\\ -4x - 10y = 62 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(–13y = 65\)</para><para>\(–8x = 65\)</para><para>\(–8y = 65\)</para><para>\(–13x = 65\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \(–13y = 65\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.2. </para><para>The correct answer is \(–13y = 65\).
      </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_0d47e68e-20c1-4143-aef1-de09980d6678" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 6x + 16y = -6\\ -6x - 10y = 6 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(6y = 0\) or \(y = 0\)</para><para>\(6x = 0\) or \(x = 0\)</para><para>\(12x = 0\) or \(x = 0\)</para><para>\(6y = 12\) or \(y = 6\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \(6y = 0\) or \(y = 0\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.2.</para><para>The correct answer is \(6y = 0\) or \(y = 0\).
      </para></solution></exercise></section>
<para>For questions 5 – 10, solve each system of equations.</para>

<section class="check-understanding"><exercise id="_1cc9948d-650a-4ef9-b839-056b65aa9185" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>
          \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 6x + 27y = -12\\ -6x - 26y = 14 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((2.5,–1)\)</para><para>\((–11,2)\)</para><para>\((7,–1)\)</para><para>\((–20,4)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \((–11,2)\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.3. 
      </para><para>The correct answer is \((–11,2)\).
      </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="f1557db3-d0fd-4804-8d97-10f35a57818c" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 3x + 4y = 8\\ -3x + 6y = 42 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((–10,2)\)</para><para>\((–14,0)\)</para><para>\((–4,5)\)</para><para>\((0,7)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \((–4,5)\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.3.
      </para><para>The correct answer is \((–4,5)\).
      </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_0260f2e2-acd6-40a4-8011-641f21a8c089" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 5x - 9y = 68\\ -5x + 6y = -47 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((7,–2)\)</para><para>\((–13,3)\)</para><para>\((19,3)\)</para><para>\((1,–7)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \((1,–7)\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.3. 

      </para><para>The correct answer is \((1,–7)\).
      </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="e8c33500-4fbe-4892-ad4f-8b0b413005da" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} -3x + 5y = -57\\ 8x - 5y = 77 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((19,0)\)</para><para>\((4,–9)\)</para><para>\((14,–3)\)</para><para>\((–1,–17)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \((4,–9)\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.3.


      </para><para>The correct answer is \((4,–9)\).
      </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_442c3edf-15b7-48af-be5b-79dcd0adfc73" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 4x - 2y = -28\\ -7x + 2y = 46 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((0,14)\)</para><para>\((4,6)\)</para><para>\((–8,–5)\)</para><para>\((–6,2)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \((–6,2)\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.3. 


      </para><para>The correct answer is \((–6,2)\).
      </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_175faaf6-d8d0-419f-abeb-9149f7a87d17" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l}  -2x + 3y = 23\\ 2x - 6y = -56 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((5,11)\)</para><para>\((2,9)\)</para><para>\((8,12)\)</para><para>\((–8,13)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \((5,11)\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.5.3.



      </para><para>The correct answer is \((5,11)\).
      </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
